description = "[PAWN_nameDef] was specially trained as an operative to be used for high-risk assassinations. [PAWN_possessive] skill with a rifle was unrivalled.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] was eventually betrayed by [PAWN_possessive] superiors when a target found out about the hit and offered to fund their future projects. [PAWN_nameDef] swore to never trust anyone again."
